        <mxCell id="legend" value="Legend — blue: interfaces/models · green: graph nodes · orange: routing/clarify · purple: memory · yellow: self-learning · red: security · gray: skills/KB/capabilities&#10;solid arrow = graph control flow · dashed = a node uses a cross-cutting subsystem · ⟲ = internal loop · TWO routings: LEVEL-1 thinking mode (reflexion-LLM) vs LEVEL-2 intent signals (embedding-kNN)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cccccc;" vertex="1" parent="1">
